      "cloud_login": {
        "title": "Sign in to your Tapo account",
        "description": "Use the account from the Tapo app, not your HA or Camera Account. No JSON file or Tapo Control needed. Continuing authorizes one verification email if Tapo requires MFA. Password and OTP are not saved. HA stores the session privately; protect HA access and backups. Region is optional (e.g. VN).",
